s Exfiltrating Data, Researchers Say, Complete With Google's Approval","k":"incident","created":"2026-09-29"},{"slug":"shinyhunters-peoplesoft-exploitation-reached-the-fbi-s-own-portal-and-mandiant-f","title":"ShinyHunters' PeopleSoft Exploitation Reached the FBI's Own Portal, and Mandiant Found It Targeting Unpatched Workarounds","k":"incident","created":"2026-09-29"},{"slug":"needymantis-a-selectively-deployed-post-compromise-framework-aimed-at-telecoms-u","title":"NeedyMantis: a Selectively Deployed Post-Compromise Framework Aimed at Telecoms, Universities and Government Contractors","k":"incident","created":"2026-09-29"},{"slug":"a-16-year-old-researcher-posed-as-titan-s-administrator-and-reached-17-3-trillio","title":"A 16-Year-Old Researcher Posed as Titan's Administrator and Reached 17.3 Trillion Rows of Microsoft Analytics Data","k":"incident","created":"2026-09-29"},{"slug":"cve-2026-88772","title":"CVE-2026-88772","k":"cve","created":"2026-09-28"},{"slug":"cve-2026-88778","title":"CVE-2026-88778","k":"cve","created":"2026-09-28"},{"slug":"one-link-opened-by-a-logged-in-administrator-was-enough-to-create-an-attacker-co","title":"One Link Opened by a Logged-In Administrator Was Enough to Create an Attacker-Controlled Admin Account on Two Million WordPress Sites","k":"incident","created":"2026-09-28"},{"slug":"shinyhunters-defaced-clop-s-own-leak-site-through-an-unpatched-grav-cms-plugin-t","title":"ShinyHunters Defaced Clop's Own Leak Site Through an Unpatched Grav CMS Plugin, Then Demanded a Ransom From the Rival Crew","k":"incident","created":"2026-09-28"},{"slug":"an-android-banking-trojan-built-with-an-ai-assistant-takes-full-device-control-a","title":"An Android Banking Trojan Built With an AI Assistant Takes Full Device Control and Hides Its Orders Behind a Telegram Dead Drop","k":"incident","created":"2026-09-28"},{"slug":"three-open-source-ai-harnesses-breached-27-companies-for-about-25-a-scan-with-th","title":"Three Open-Source AI Harnesses Breached