html\">Ke3Chang</a> \u2014 China-linked actor, same attribution class</li>\n<li><a href=\"mustang-panda.html\">Mustang Panda</a> \u2014 China-linked actor, same attribution class</li>\n<li><a href=\"earth-lusca.html\">Earth Lusca</a> \u2014 China-linked actor, same attribution class</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Provenance</h2>\n<p>Stub generated from MITRE ATT&amp;CK <code>G1048</code> on 2026-09-24. ATT&amp;CK is the publisher of this page's technique and alias data; the attribution wording above is ATT&amp;CK's, not this wiki's.</p>","out":["earth-lusca","ke3chang","mitre-attack","mustang-panda"],"sources":[{"url":"https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1048/","label":"G1048"}],"in":[]},{"k":"entity","slug":"transparent-tribe","title":"Transparent Tribe \u2014 Pakistan-Linked Threat Actor","created":"2026-09-24","updated":"2026-09-24","confidence":"medium","severity":"","au":false,"tags":["apt-group","nation-state"],"sectors":[],"summary":"Transparent Tribe is a suspected Pakistan-based threat group that has been active since at least 2013, primarily targeting diplomatic, defense, and research organizations in India and Afghanistan.","sections":["Attribution \u2014 as claimed","Known TTPs","Related Pages","Provenance"],"tables":2,"words":188,"body":"<h1>Transparent Tribe</h1>\n<p>Transparent Tribe is a suspected Pakistan-based threat group that has been active since at least 2013, primarily targeting diplomatic, defense, and research organizations in India and Afghanistan.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Attribute</th>\n<th>Detail</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>ATT&amp;CK ID</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0134/\">G0134</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Aliases</strong></td>\n<td>COPPER FIELDSTONE, APT36, Mythic Leopard, ProjectM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Attribution</strong></td>\n<td>Pakistan</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Class</strong></td>\n<td>state</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Active since</strong></td>\n<td>2013 (per